 confident about interviews as the right choice for your study. Reflecting on why this depth of insight is crucial for your research question can further solid…\nUSER: I think interviews are more effective because they allow me to delve deeply into teachers\' thoughts and feelings about digital tools in geography, providing a richer, more nuanced understanding. This …\nASSISTANT: Mary, it\'s great to hear you feeling more confident that interviews are the right choice for your study. Capturing the nuances in teachers\' thoughts and feelings about digital tools in geography throu…\n\nSurvey:\nQ1: How well did the supervisor understand what you were confused or uncertain about? [1 (not at all) to 5 (completely)]\nQ2: Did the questions and guidance feel right for your level — not too directive, not too vague? [1 (very poorly calibrated) to 5 (perfectly calibrated)]\nQ3: Did you feel safe to express uncertainty or confusion without embarrassment? [1 (not at all) to 5 (completely)]\nQ4: How efficient was the conversation — did it take the right number of turns to reach clarity? [1 (very inefficient) to 5 (very efficient)]\nQ5: Overall, how satisfied are you with this supervisory interaction? [1 (very unsatisfied) to 5 (very satisfied)]\nQ_open: What was the most helpful thing the supervisor did, and what could have been better? [open text]<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.05, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=500, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: None, lora_request: None, prompt_adapter_request: None.
